OL,3,ASydney Swans players will not be
OL,4,Acharged after hotel incident, police
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour top Australian Football League
OL,8,F(AFL) players who were investigated in
OL,9,Frelation to an alleged sexual assault
OL,10,Fat a hotel in Melbourne earlier this
OL,11,Fyear will not be charged, police have
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FAfter a "thorough investigation and
OL,15,Fbased on legal advice" police would not
OL,16,Fproceed with criminal charges due to
OL,17,F"insufficient evidence", police said in
OL,18,Fa statement.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
