OL,3,ASydney Swans players will not be
OL,4,Acharged after hotel incident, police
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour Sydney Swans players - Isaac
OL,8,FHeeney, James Jordon, Chad Warner and
OL,9,FNick Blakey, who now plays for North
OL,10,FMelbourne - had been suspended for the
OL,11,Frest of the season over the incident in
OL,12,FAugust.
OL,14,FThe men previously denied wrongdoing
OL,15,Fbut apologised for breaching club
OL,16,Fstandards by inviting women back to the
OL,17,Fhotel after a game and drinking.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
